---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import suzzaAvatar from "../assets/img/suzza-avatar.jpg";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="About"
      description="This is a website about my cross stitch journey."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center article-header bg-hero p-25 text-black-900"
      >
        <h1>About Suzza</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-4">
        <div class="col-span-2 bg-gradient"></div>
        <div
          class="col-span-10 main-content text-black-900 lar padding-y-xxl"
        >
          <section>
            <h2>What this is all about</h2>

            <p>
              Hi, welcome to Suzza Stitches. This is the place where I talk
              about cross stitching. It’s like a Flosstube but more stationary.
              I’ll be sharing my Works in Progress (WIPs) and my finishes. Maybe
              a few Fully Finished Objects (FFO). I take great joy in seeing
              other people’s stitching and I’m sometimes inspired to take up new
              pieces. We are a community that likes to enable.
            </p><p>
              I’ll be sharing haul too! I love collecting fabric and patterns. I
              have more in my stash than I will ever stitch. I might go through
              and share a few with you too. I’m hoping that if you like what you
              see that you will leave a comment. Share your links to your
              Youtube or Instagram so we can check out your work. Let me know
              what you are working on! I’m always interested in seeing people’s
              work and their progress.
            </p>

            <h2>Who I am</h2>

            <p>
              <Image
                src={suzzaAvatar}
                alt="Profile Picture for Suzza Silver"
                class="float-right w-auto rounded-full h-50"
                loading="eager"
                style="box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);"
                layout="full-width"
              />

              I am Suzza, a person who has made an income from the internet
              since about 2011. I started as freelance writer and worked my way
              into Community Management. Community managers are the one that
              post, respond, and moderate communities. I often explain it as
              this. If you Tweet at Coca Cola, and someone responds to you, it
              is probably a community manager. You will mostly find us in forums
              but sometimes on social media as well.
            </p><p>
              My first love is blogging though. I have a writing style that is
              well suited to the medium. I’ve always found success when I write.
              I’m working on trying to get published in a proper publication.
              Hoping to make the leap into more serious journalism. I’m
              currently working on a project about the mathematician GH Hardy.
              He is my favorite and I believe that he is misunderstood. I’m
              hoping to write something that will help people see him in a new
              way. As warmly as I do.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <Footer />
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
